// A C function of a class calls a contract method (priority 0) of its own class by its name alone, next to a concurrent contract call (priority 0): refused (a reviewer's chart).
scchart T {
  output int p, o
  int n
  class C { schedule s int v
    int get() schedule s 0 { return v }
    void run() { for (int i = 0; i < 1; i++) { p = get() } }
    void set() schedule s 0 { v = 1 }
  } c
  region R { initial state A do c.run() go to B state B }
  region S { initial state X do c.set() go to Y state Y }
}
